{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1093","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Letters Rearranging"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$ consisting only of lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can rearrange all letters of this string as you wish. Your task is to obtain a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string by rearranging the letters of the given string or report that it is impossible to do it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call a string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is not a palindrome. Palindrome is a string which is read from left to right the same as from right to left. For example, strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abacaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are palindromes and strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"xd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$t$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"independent"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 100$$$) — number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$t$$$ lines contains one string. The $$$i$$$-th line contains a string $$$s_i$$$ consisting only of lowercase Latin letter. It is guaranteed that the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"length"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of $$$s_i$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"from $$$1$$$ to $$$1000$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (inclusive)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$t$$$ lines. In the $$$i$$$-th line print the answer to the $$$i$$$-th query: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is impossible to obtain a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string by rearranging the letters of $$$s_i$$$ and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string which can be obtained from the given one (by rearranging the letters) otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\naa\nabacaba\nxdd\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n-1\nabaacba\nxdd"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first query we cannot rearrange letters to obtain a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Other examples (not all) of correct answers to the second query: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ababaca"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcabaa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"baacaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third query we can do nothing to obtain a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1093B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1093/problem/B"}